@startuml class-pipeline
hide empty members
title Pipeline, stages and LLM layer

class Pipeline {
  +stages: list[Stage]
  +config: Config
  +{static} from_config(config: Config): Pipeline
  +run(path: str | Path): Document
}

class Config {
  +llm: bool = True
  +stages: list[str]
  +text_model: str
  +vision_model: str
  +thresholds: dict[str, float]
  +cache_dir: Path
  +{static} from_toml(path): Config
}

class Context {
  +config: Config
  +llm: LLMClient | None
  +cache: ResponseCache | None
  +prompts: PromptRegistry
  +trace: Logger
}

interface Stage <<Protocol>> {
  +name: str
  +run(doc: Document, ctx: Context): Document
}

class IngestStage
class BoilerplateStage
class RegionsStage
class LayoutStage
class StructureStage
class CleanupStage
class LLMResolutionStage
class FinalizeStage

interface TableExtractor <<Protocol>> {
  +name: str
  +extract(pdf: Path, page: int, region: BBox): list[TableCandidate]
}
class PyMuPDFTables
class PdfplumberTables
class CamelotLattice
class CamelotStream

interface OcrEngine <<Protocol>> {
  +recognize(image: bytes): str
}

interface LLMClient <<Protocol>> {
  +generate(model: str, prompt: str, schema: dict, images: list[bytes] = []): dict
  +is_available(): bool
}
class OllamaClient {
  +host: str
  +temperature: float = 0
  +seed: int
}
class FakeLLMClient <<test>> {
  +responses: dict
}

class ResponseCache {
  +directory: Path
  +key(model, prompt_version, payload): str
  +get(key: str): dict | None
  +put(key: str, value: dict): None
}

class PromptRegistry {
  +get(kind: RequestKind): Prompt
}

class Prompt {
  +kind: RequestKind
  +version: str
  +template: str
  +schema: dict
  +render(payload: dict): str
}

class Chunker {
  +max_tokens: int
  +split(doc: Document): list[Chunk]
}

class "markdown" as MdExport <<module>> {
  +to_markdown(doc: Document): str
}
class "json" as JsonExport <<module>> {
  +to_json(doc: Document, indent): str
}

Pipeline o-- "*" Stage
Pipeline --> Config
Pipeline ..> Context : creates per run
Context --> Config
Context --> "0..1" LLMClient
Context --> "0..1" ResponseCache
Context --> PromptRegistry
PromptRegistry *-- "*" Prompt

Stage <|.. IngestStage
Stage <|.. BoilerplateStage
Stage <|.. RegionsStage
Stage <|.. LayoutStage
Stage <|.. StructureStage
Stage <|.. CleanupStage
Stage <|.. LLMResolutionStage
Stage <|.. FinalizeStage

RegionsStage o-- "*" TableExtractor
RegionsStage o-- "0..1" OcrEngine
TableExtractor <|.. PyMuPDFTables
TableExtractor <|.. PdfplumberTables
TableExtractor <|.. CamelotLattice
TableExtractor <|.. CamelotStream

LLMResolutionStage ..> LLMClient : uses via Context
LLMResolutionStage ..> ResponseCache
LLMResolutionStage ..> PromptRegistry
LLMClient <|.. OllamaClient
LLMClient <|.. FakeLLMClient

Chunker ..> MdExport : renders block text

note right of LLMResolutionStage
  Groups pending requests by model:
  text-model batch first, then vision batch.
  One retry on invalid output, then the
  classical decision stands.
end note

note bottom of Context
  llm is None in no-LLM mode or
  when Ollama is unreachable.
end note
@enduml
